title open-image — the finger-driven Photos editor: a finger edits the picture, the glass repaints, from one cursor
prompt Continue the autonomous loop — next agent-doable lap the Long Return Lila, self-approve design rounds, send each finished increment as its own signed round, stop only at custody gates.
think open-image read a finger into an edit_input.Gesture but moved no cursor; open-image owned a cursor and painted it but took a gesture already made; open-image applied a gesture to a cursor. Three proven pieces standing slightly apart. A real device wants one object it hands raw finger coordinates to and watches the picture change — the touch surface and the glass sharing one history.
think The scroll arc already closed exactly this at open-image (TouchView bound the finger session and the painted view to one cursor so the page never drifts). the Long Return Lila picked the symmetric edit capstone: the finger-driven view, composing only proven parts, living in brushstroke/ beside edit_touch_view (the assembly where the cursor+preview binding already resolves).
think Shape: brushstroke/edit_finger_view.rye EditFingerView { input: EditTouch (open-image), view: EditTouchView (open-image) } — open opens both sub-surfaces so a bad grid refuses BadView and a bad cell/swipe refuses BadCell/BadSwipe, each once; bind lays a strip verb (StripFull); finger_down arms; finger_up classifies through open-image and, when a gesture fires, applies it through open-image to the ONE owned cursor; paint delegates to open-image. The crux: the finger and the picture share one cursor, so the glass cannot drift from what the finger did, structurally — the same one-graph discipline open-image used for scroll.
obs Built GREEN first metal run, no red — the REDS #76 loom held (native assert out contains), so the GREEN line's apostrophes never threatened the witness. Symlinked image/edit_touch_input.rye into brushstroke/ so open-image resolves in the assembly (mirroring edit_input/edit_cursor/photo_edits/qoi already symlinked there). No compound asserts; one positive invariant per line.
obs Witness reads behavior on glass over an 8x8 two-tone, 2x2 grid, one-verb (flip_h) strip, ten-pixel cell: a fresh surface paints the source (left cell red), a tap on the strip cell repaints the flip (left cell blue), a left swipe repaints the source and a right swipe the flip; a tap off the strip fires nothing (picture unchanged); paint equals a direct view.paint cell-for-cell (no drift); the view rasterizes to a lit canvas with blue in the left cell; a zero grid, a zero cell, and a zero swipe each refuse at open. open-image classifier, open-image view, open-image seam GREEN beneath; tame bans clean, width exit 0.
loom witness=hunk_edit_finger_view_witness image=8x8_two_tone grid=2x2 strip=flip_h cell_px=10 swipe_px=12 events=tap_commit,left_undo,right_redo drift_check=paint==view.paint refusals=BadView,BadCell,BadSwipe
file brushstroke/edit_finger_view.rye open-image — EditFingerView binds open-image's finger classifier and open-image's painted view to one cursor; a finger edits, the glass repaints, and the picture cannot drift from the finger.
file brushstroke/edit_touch_input.rye symlink to image/edit_touch_input.rye so open-image resolves in the brushstroke assembly.
file tools/hunk_edit_finger_view_witness.rish proves the surface on metal — a tap repaints the edit on glass, swipes repaint the walked history, a tap off the strip does nothing, no drift, bad geometry refuses.
file active-designing/20260813-205200_hunk-edit-finger-view-exploration.md self-approved design read.
file work-in-progress/REMEMBER.md git nib refreshed in this same work commit.
recommend keep-going — the Photos editing story now stands whole end to end (input seam open-image · touchable view open-image · finger classifier open-image · finger-driven view open-image), the exact mirror of the browse story (open-image–47). open-image could paint the gesture strip as a Skate row of verb chips beside the picture (reusing open-image's down-map), record a raw finger session content-addressed (composing open-image's edit store), or open a fresh Chapter-A / double-seat journey. The served-market module-assembly ruling and hardware buys stay Keaton's gates.
